ing to be sustained and  stronger as a result of the facts that  happen going forward and that's what we  found and just to pick up on that point  I mean there has been support from a  certain number of Democratic lawmakers  for impeachment but the Democratic  leadership in Congress has been much  less enthusiastic about focusing on that  topic or on that goal do you feel that  they are too timid what your what's your  response to the message that Democratic  leaders are  sending back about this effort well what  they've said publicly is they don't  think this is the time for it and what  we've found you know as I said we're  really a grassroots organization we're  trying to communicate directly with the  American people and give them a voice  and I don't think it's any secret the  this president is not a secret his  danger to the American people is not a  secret what he's doing on a daily basis  is is apparent to almost every American  so from our standpoint not to try to  counteract his danger not to try and  stand up to the threat to the American  people to us this is an urgent issue  where we're just telling the truth and  we're asking them we're trying to allow  Americans together to state that truth  so from our standpoint we're not trying  we don't really understand the political  calculation about whether this is smart  or dumb what we're trying to do is  what's right right but you think this is  right and important so the fact of the  matter is we don't think we don't think  it's a secret to the American people  that this president is scary so I don't  even understand that argument but not to  get hung up on this point  whenever democratic leaders as you  rightly or accurately characterize them  as saying this is not the right time you  think they're wrong in saying that well  obviously we're doing it now so yeah we  think that we think that this is an  urgent issue to the safety of Americans  and there's no time when we're gonna put  say we don't think we 